# Luminary marker — cli#463 fixture race
- date: 2026-11-05
- branch: fix/463-lite-fixture-race
- lead: john-ousterhout — the fixture had no owner, so four files each owned
  it. One setup with one job replaces four copies of a repair. The comments
  in those copies pointed at each other, which is what a missing owner looks
  like in review.
- supporting: michael-nygard (the failure was invisible in the right way —
  it named `init` assertions, not the fixture, and moved between runs),
  tony-hoare (the setup checks its own postcondition: the bundler exiting 0
  is not evidence the fixture landed)
